# Trivy misconfiguration suppressions for this repo (intentional, documented).

# AVD-DS-0002 — only for lambda/scope/placeholder/Dockerfile: the Lambda base
# image (public.ecr.aws/lambda/nodejs) manages the runtime user itself, so a
# USER directive is not applicable there. The worker image (Dockerfile) does
# drop root with USER 10001:10001 and needs no suppression.
AVD-DS-0002

# AVD-AWS-0031 — the placeholder ECR repo uses mutable 'latest-<arch>' tags by
# design (a mirrored placeholder image, overwritten in place).
AVD-AWS-0031
